<div class="min-h-screen bg-white px-6 py-12">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
    <a href="<%= root_path %>" class="text-blue-600 mb-8 inline-block">← Home</a>

    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold mb-8">How matching works</h1>

    <div class="space-y-6 text-gray-700">
      <p>
        The Recipe Finder helps you discover what you can cook with the ingredients you already have.
      </p>

      <p>
        When you enter your ingredients, the app ranks recipes by how many ingredients you're missing.
        Recipes requiring the fewest additional items appear first.
      </p>

      <p>
        Pantry staples (salt, pepper, oil, butter, sugar, flour) are assumed to always be available and don't count against your match percentage.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-12 pt-8 border-t">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-4">Transparency</h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">
        This application was built with the help of AI tools (Claude) for code generation and assistance.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
